Package: MetaCONCUR
Title: Meta-Analysis Approach for Copy Number Profile Curve-Based Association Tests
Version: 0.0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    c(
      person("Yuhuan", "Cheng", role = "aut"),
      person("Shannon T.", "Holloway", 
       email = "shannon.t.holloway@gmail.com", 
       role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Jung-Ying", "Tzeng", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Implements a meta-analysis approach for CNV collapsing tests by 
    extending the CONCUR method of Brucker et al. Includes two steps -
    1. Worker step, which takes individual-level data input and generate portable 
    summary statistics for each study; 2. Meta steps, which collects and aligns 
    study-specific summary statistics, then performs meta-analysis to get p-value.
